IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aca-adoption`

-- Adoption of Children Act 2022, ss 4 to 6, 11, 14, 20, 26, 37, 42, 48, 53 to 57 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_adoption-of-children-act-2022.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

